1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,460
Alright team, big project just landed.

2
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,620
What's the timeline looking like, boss?

3
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:09,040
Tight. We need to deliver by Friday.

4
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:12,200
Friday? That's only three days away!

5
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:15,880
I know it's ambitious. Let's make it work.

6
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:19,820
We'll do our best, but this is pushing it.

7
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,240
Did you hear that? Friday for the whole thing!

8
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:41,400
I know, right? It's completely insane.

9
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:45,080
How are we supposed to pull that off?

10
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:48,760
We'll have to work overtime, probably all night.

11
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:52,440
My social life is officially on hold then.

12
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:56,380
Tell me about it. We're in for a ride.

13
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,720
Can you believe this deadline? It's nuts!

14
00:08:23,420 --> 00:08:26,140
I'm already feeling stressed out about it.

15
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:29,560
Coffee break needed. I need a moment.

16
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:32,980
Same here. I might pull an all-nighter.

17
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:36,400
This project is going to kill me.

18
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:40,080
Don't say that! We'll get through this, somehow.

19
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,720
We just need to prioritize and focus.

20
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:46,140
Yeah, break it down into smaller tasks.

21
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:49,560
And delegate what we can, of course.

22
00:12:50,260 --> 00:12:53,240
Good idea. Two heads are better than one.

23
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:56,920
Let's grab a whiteboard and brainstorm right now.

24
00:12:57,620 --> 00:13:00,080
Alright, let's do this. Power through!

